      "message": "Nothing in this file is Realtek specific.  Why is this tied to the Realtek part number?  This probably should just be called lpm_driver.c\n\nAlso, instead of creating an array of PDC ports, lpm_driver.c could support multiple driver instances by using the `DT_INST_FOREACH_STATUS_OKAY` macro.\n\nIt\u0027s slightly more costly in terms of flash space, but eliminates all of the arrays that you\u0027ve allocated of `NUM_PORTS` size.",
